cue0001379
01:00:26.000 --> 01:00:33.500
As part of the tradition, you pay $20 an hour, and I give you 100 minakrim, temanim, they do it for you.

cue0001380
01:00:33.500 --> 01:00:38.500
And they do it as clean and so on. As a matter of fact, it was done.

cue0001381
01:00:38.500 --> 01:00:43.000
One second, no, no, no, let me speak. I understand. One second, no, let me finish.

cue0001382
01:00:43.000 --> 01:00:50.500
As a matter of fact, the same people that tell you, tell you, cannot be done,

cue0001383
