cue0001388
01:01:28.500 --> 01:01:34.100
which are, they could pull the whole sinew in one shot, they tell me,

cue0001389
01:01:34.100 --> 01:01:36.300
you know, they know how to clean it, they are the professionals.

cue0001390
01:01:36.300 --> 01:01:48.600
