cue0001392
01:01:56.300 --> 01:02:38.012
There is and that the problem with having Kashrut as a private enterprise I feel my belief is they should go into the community you know to go to the State of Israel why I don care to whom but they should not go to private people That the the the the maybe I want to change the topic you have other topics to discuss Rabbi is there any importance to keeping for example here in our small Midrash we have different people that come from different parts of the world with different minhagim

